		c	{@return a new stand-alone registry entry}\n\n<p>This should not be called manually. Call {@link net.minecraft.registry.Registry#entryOf} or\n{@link net.minecraft.registry.Registry#getEntry} instead.\n\n<p>Callers are responsible for filling the value later by calling {@link\n#setValue}.
		p	1	registryKey		
